{"id":338245,"communityId":357,"institutionId":157,"name":"(un)Jaded","shortName":null,"nameSortKey":"U","websiteKey":"unjaded","email":"unjadedatx@gmail.com","description":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(un)Jaded is a mental health and service organization intended to destigmatize mental health and encourage social advocacy amongst the AAPI community. (un)Jaded recognizes the need for a culturally aware space that is committed to celebrating Asian identities, addressing intersectional issues, and promoting greater community involvement. Membership is open to self-identified Asians, Pacific Islanders, Asian Americans, and allies attending the University of Texas at Austin.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(un)Jaded will advocate for and educate on its values of...</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mental Health</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Social Advocacy</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Community Outreach</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2026 Membership Update:</strong> <em>If you're interested in joining, please visit&nbsp;@unjadedatx on Instagram to learn more! Sign up to join our <a href=\"https://forms.gle/216quFu8fEahVdgq8\">mailing list</a>, and we'll keep you updated once Recruitment begins. Please do NOT request to join the org through Hornslink.</em></p>\r\n<p><strong><em>Join us in Gearing 114 on Thursdays from 6-7pm. </em></strong></p>","summary":"(un)Jaded is a mental health and service organization intended to destigmatize mental health and encourage social advocacy amongst the AAPI community and its allies.","status":"Active","comment":null,"showJoin":true,"statusChangeDateTime":null,"startDate":"2021-05-19T00:00:00-04:00","endDate":null,"parentId":85548,"wallId":null,"discussionId":38589126,"groupTypeId":null,"organizationTypeId":2697,"cssConfigurationId":null,"deleted":fa